        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Baldwin TUB-CRR, Contemporary Tube Lever with Round Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Tube Lever with Round Rose is available in Satin Nickel, Polished Nickel, Satin Black, Venetian Bronze, and Polished Chrome finishes. This modern leverset is easy to install and will fit most pre-drilled doors. It has an adjustable latch to fit 2-3/4 inch or 2-3/8 inch backsets. The Tube lever will accommodate doors 1-3/8 inches up to 2-1/2 inches thick. It is available in keyed, passage, privacy, and dummy functions. Backed by Baldwin's standard of excellence, the Tube Lever with Contemporary Round Rose has a lifetime mechanical warranty and a 25 year finish warranty.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Baldwin Reserve Tube Lever with Contemporary Round Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>2-1/8\" cross bore and 1\" edge bore for latch</li>\r\n<li>Latch Bolt: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike: square corner</li>\r\n<li>Keyed entry features the Baldwin 5-pin tumbler C keyway.</li>\r\n<li>Tested to exceed ANSI/BHMA Grade 2 Security.</li>\r\n<li>Warranty: 25 year finish warranty and a limited lifetime mechanical warranty.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Modern Leverset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Keyed Entry Projection: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" - 2\" standard with optional thick door kit for 2\" - 2-1/2\".</li>\r\n<li>Backset: Adjustable for 2-3/4\" or 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Latchbolt: 1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Half Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working lever. Non-locking and non-latching trim for one side of door. This inactive pull is usually used to match trim. </li>\r\n<li><b>Full Dummy:</b> Non-working levers. Non-locking and non-latching trim for both sides of door. These inactive pulls are usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> Latches but does not lock. The latch is activated by turning the either of the two levers.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> Latches and can be locked. Can be locked from the inside with a push-button.</li>\r\n<li><b>Keyed Entry:</b> Use when a keyed lock is needed. An ANSI/BHMA A156.2 Grade 2 security lock that is operated by a key from the exterior and a turnbutton on the lever from the interior. Complete set - 2 levers, 2 roses, 2 keys, door latch and strike plate.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually. Interior roses and Half Dummy roses have exposed screws.</i>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/BAL-Contemporary-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354513\" width=\"600\" height=\"124\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Baldwin Reserve Finish Options\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Tube Lever with Round Rose",
                "description": "Baldwin TUB-CRR, Tube Lever with Round Rose - The Tube Lever with Round Rose is available in  Satin Nickel, Polished Nickel, Satin Black, Venetian Bronze, and Polished Chrome finishes.  This modern leverset is easy to install and will fit most pre-drilled doors. It has an adjustable latch to fit 2-3/4 inch or 2-3/8 inch backsets. The Tube lever will accommodate doors 1-3/8 inches up to 2-1/2 inches thick. It is available in keyed, passage, privacy, and dummy functions. Backed by Baldwin's standard of excellence, the Tube Lever with Contemporary Round Rose has a lifetime mechanical warranty and a 25 year finish warranty.",
